The media interest in the “cured” baby has been as intense or more than
anything I have experienced here at NIH.   Yesterday I did WUSA 9 nightly news and 
today I did: CBS Morning News with Charlie Rose and Nora O’Donnell; WTOP Radio; 
Fax Morning News; CBS Radio LA; Fox Radio News; NBC News and NBC Nightly 
News; ABC Evening News; BBC World Service Radio; Canadian Broadcast (CBC) TV; 
CNN International with Christianne Amanpour; CNN Situation Room with Wolf Blitzer; 
WLS radio; PBS NewsHour with Ray Suarez; BBC Radio; Canada CNN Radio; CNN 
Anderson Cooper 360; Al Jazeera.   Quite a day.   I stressed that we must be careful since 
this is only a single case in very unusual circumstances.   All media went very well.
